{"code":"it-IT","name":"Italian","native":"Italiano","badge":"IT","tts":"it-IT","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"Non capisco.","say":"nohn kah-PEES-koh","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.2","t":"Non lo so.","say":"nohn loh SOH","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"Un momento, per favore.","say":"oon moh-MEN-toh, pair fah-VOH-reh","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"Può ripetere?","say":"pwoh ree-PEH-teh-reh","en":"Can you say that again?","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"Più piano, per favore.","say":"pyoo PYAH-noh, pair fah-VOH-reh","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"Come si dice “…”?","say":"KOH-meh see DEE-cheh","en":"How do you say “…”?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"Certo.","say":"CHAIR-toh","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"Esatto.","say":"eh-ZAHT-toh","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"Penso di sì.","say":"PEN-soh dee SEE","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"Davvero?","say":"dahv-VEH-roh","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"Nessun problema.","say":"nes-SOON proh-BLEH-mah","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"Che bello!","say":"keh BEL-loh","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"Dov’è {x}?","say":"doh-VEH {x}","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"Vorrei {x}.","say":"vor-RAY {x}","en":"I'd like {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"Avete {x}?","say":"ah-VEH-teh {x}","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"{x}, per favore.","say":"{x}, pair fah-VOH-reh","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"Devo {x}.","say":"DEH-voh {x}","en":"I have to {x}.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"leave"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"Posso {x}?","say":"POS-soh {x}","en":"Can I {x}?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"comein"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"Controllo.","say":"kon-TROL-loh","en":"I'll check it.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"Ho una riunione.","say":"oh OO-nah ree-oo-NYOH-neh","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"È piccante?","say":"eh peek-KAHN-teh","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"Senza cipolla, per favore.","say":"SEN-tsah chee-POL-lah, pair fah-VOH-reh","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"Cosa mi consiglia?","say":"KOH-zah mee kon-SEEL-yah","en":"What do you recommend?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"Non mangio carne.","say":"nohn MAHN-joh KAR-neh","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"Quanto costa?","say":"KWAHN-toh KOS-tah","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"Sto solo guardando.","say":"stoh SOH-loh gwar-DAHN-doh","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"Lo prendo.","say":"loh PREN-doh","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"Posso pagare con la carta?","say":"POS-soh pah-GAH-reh kon lah KAR-tah","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"È lontano?","say":"eh lon-TAH-noh","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"All’aeroporto, per favore.","say":"ahl-lah-eh-roh-POR-toh, pair fah-VOH-reh","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"a sinistra · a destra · dritto","say":"ah see-NEE-strah · ah DES-trah · DREET-toh","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"Aiuto!","say":"ah-YOO-toh","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"Non c’è carta igienica.","say":"nohn cheh KAR-tah ee-JEH-nee-kah","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"Mi sento male.","say":"mee SEN-toh MAH-leh","en":"I feel sick.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"Chiami un’ambulanza, per favore.","say":"KYAH-mee oo-nahm-boo-LAHN-tsah","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"Piacere.","say":"pyah-CHEH-reh","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"Di dove sei?","say":"dee DOH-veh SAY","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"Che lavoro fai?","say":"keh lah-VOH-roh FAI","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"È buonissimo!","say":"eh bwoh-NEES-see-moh","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"Ciao.","say":"CHOW","en":"Hello.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"Buongiorno.","say":"bwon-JOR-noh","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"Come stai?","say":"KOH-meh STAI","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"Sì. · No.","say":"see · noh","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"Per favore.","say":"pair fah-VOH-reh","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"Grazie.","say":"GRAHT-tsyeh","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"Scusi.","say":"SKOO-zee","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"Arrivederci.","say":"ar-ree-veh-DAIR-chee","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"uno · due · tre","say":"OO-noh · DOO-eh · treh","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"quattro · cinque · sei","say":"KWAHT-troh · CHEEN-kweh · say","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"sette · otto · nove","say":"SET-teh · OT-toh · NOH-veh","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"dieci · venti · cento","say":"DYEH-chee · VEN-tee · CHEN-toh","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"La mela è rossa.","say":"lah MEH-lah eh ROS-sah","en":"The apple is red.","note":"adjective after the noun · rossa agrees with la"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"Mangio la mela.","say":"MAHN-joh lah MEH-lah","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"-o = I, so no “io” needed"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"Ho mangiato la mela.","say":"oh mahn-JAH-toh lah MEH-lah","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"past: avere + participle"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"Voglio mangiare la mela.","say":"VOL-yoh mahn-JAH-reh lah MEH-lah","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"helper + infinitive"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"Mangi le mele?","say":"MAHN-jee leh MEH-leh","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"the voice goes up to ask"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"il bagno","say":"eel BAHN-yoh","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"la farmacia","say":"lah far-mah-CHEE-ah","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"l’ospedale","say":"los-peh-DAH-leh","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"la stazione","say":"lah stah-TSYOH-neh","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"l’aeroporto","say":"lah-eh-roh-POR-toh","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"l’albergo","say":"lahl-BAIR-goh","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"dell’acqua","say":"del-LAHK-kwah","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink"},{"id":"coffee","t":"un caffè","say":"oon kahf-FEH","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink"},{"id":"bill","t":"il conto","say":"eel KON-toh","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"il menù","say":"eel meh-NOO","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"una birra","say":"OO-nah BEER-rah","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"questo","say":"KWES-toh","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"una busta","say":"OO-nah BOOS-tah","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"la riunione","say":"lah ree-oo-NYOH-neh","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"il file","say":"eel FILE","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"lo schermo","say":"loh SKAIR-moh","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"il messaggio","say":"eel mes-SAHJ-joh","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"domani","say":"doh-MAH-nee","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"},{"id":"leave","t":"andare","say":"ahn-DAH-reh","en":"go","kind":"verb","tags":"leave go"},{"id":"comein","t":"entrare","say":"en-TRAH-reh","en":"come in","kind":"verb","tags":"enter"},{"id":"pay","t":"pagare","say":"pah-GAH-reh","en":"pay","kind":"verb","tags":"card cash"}],"diet":{"title":"Allergia · per favore legga","ask":"Questo piatto contiene uno di questi ingredienti?","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"Grazie mille!","note":"","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"Ho una grave allergia alle arachidi. Non posso mangiare arachidi né olio di arachidi.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"Ho una grave allergia ai crostacei e ai molluschi (gamberi, granchi, cozze).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"Non posso mangiare glutine (frumento, orzo, segale).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"Non mangio carne, pollo né pesce.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"Non mangio carne di maiale.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"BAGNO · TOILETTE","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"DONNE · UOMINI","en":"Women · Men"},{"t":"USCITA · ENTRATA","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"SPINGERE · TIRARE","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"USCITA DI SICUREZZA","en":"Emergency exit"}]}